    "description": "Wire 1.5, Dispatch wire 1.5: the record keys of Paykit's natural keys, each in its collection under its policy, blinded with the naming key of the identity whose Dispatch holds it (identity, keys.json): natural_key (and natural_key_hex) is the natural key, blinded_natural_key its blind, derive(\"pubky-dispatch/v1/name\", naming_key, natural_key), key_material_hex the input of the record key, lp(collection, blinded_natural_key, policy_hash), and record_key derive(\"pubky-dispatch/v1/record\", collection, blinded_natural_key, policy_hash). The request hashes are those of messages.json's payment_request, payment_request_recurring (its February period, 1772236800) and payment_request_labelled, whose payee record is under the policy of its label shop1. The last is the settlements bucket of the settlement of the payment without a request, whose settlement ID is the UTF-8 bytes of settlement_id, given as such rather than read from a proof, held at bob's Dispatch: settlement_tag_input_hex is lp(settlement ID), blinded_settlement_tag_input its blind, settlement_tag_hex the settlement's tag, derive(\"paykit/v1/settlement\", \"tag\", blinded_settlement_tag_input), bucket u16_be(tag[0..2]) >> 6, mark_settlement_tag_hex bytes 2 to 13 of the tag, which its mark stores, and natural_key lp(u64(bucket)); occurrence_tag_hex is the first 8 bytes of derive(\"paykit/v1/settlement\", \"occurrence\", occurrence_blinded_natural_key), the blind of the natural key of the occurrence it was credited to, bob's payee record of that payment."
